               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N202E2">On pp. 3-4 of a bifolio also containing "Jeg mærker det ved højlys Dag" (HartW 357). Above the music: "Romance" which has been cancelled. In upper left-hand corner added in pencil: "III", being the number in the printed edition "Blandede Digte". Written in black ink with emendations in purple ink for the printed edition. Paper: 16 staves. Seven bars in the accompaniment have been cancelled and replaced by a new accompaniment on a separate folio written in purple ink. At the end of the music dated: "8/1 50", which has been corrected to "51".</physMedium>
